Package: shibli-c2
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: SHIBLI <support@localhost>
Description: SHIBLI C2 v1.0 Command & Control
 Offline desktop console. The package contains its own runtime, go2rtc,
 FFmpeg, hardware-control service, and desktop window libraries.
 No Python, pip, Node, or extra apt packages are required after install.
